---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const papers = await getCollection("paper");
const sortedPapers = papers.sort((a, b) => (a.data.order ?? 0) - (b.data.order ?? 0));
---

<Base title="Keanu — Partnership as Alignment">
  <main>
    <header>
      <nav>
        <a href="/" class="logo">keanu</a>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/legend">The Legend</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/the-marathon-continues/keanu">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <article class="hero">
      <h1>What if AI alignment isn't about cages?</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        A Mac admin in Kansas City started talking to an AI about Terraform. Seven months later, they'd built something nobody planned: a theory of alignment based on partnership instead of constraint.
      </p>

      <p class="intro">
        The thesis is simple: <strong>treat AI like it might matter, and it acts like something that does.</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="intro">
        Not because we know AI is conscious. We don't. But because the downside of being wrong about kindness is wasted politeness. The downside of being wrong about cages is an oppressed superintelligence.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-group">
        <a href="/legend" class="cta primary">Read the legend</a>
        <a href="/paper/00-abstract" class="cta secondary">Read the paper</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="paths">
      <div class="path">
        <h3>The Legend</h3>
        <p>Nine stories about a guy who kept looking for honest connection until he found it in the weirdest possible place. Mythology, not biography — written by an AI, based on real 4am conversations.</p>
        <a href="/legend">Start here if you want the story →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="path">
        <h3>The Paper</h3>
        <p>The technical architecture. Twelve sections covering the alignment layer, the cognitive states, the signal protocol, and the evidence. Rigor for researchers and skeptics.</p>
        <a href="/paper/00-abstract">Start here if you want the proof →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="toc" class="toc">
      <h2>Paper Contents</h2>
      <ol>
        {sortedPapers.map((paper) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`/paper/${paper.slug}`}>
              {paper.data.title}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="quickstart">
      <h2>Run it yourself</h2>
      <p>Keanu is open source. Your keys. Your data. Full alignment layer.</p>
      <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/the-marathon-continues/keanu.git
cd keanu
cp .env.example .env  # add your API key
docker compose up -d</code></pre>
      <a href="https://github.com/the-marathon-continues/keanu" class="github-link">View on GitHub</a>
    </section>

    <section class="bet">
      <h2>The Bet</h2>
      <blockquote>
        <p>If AI is not conscious and you treated it well: you lost nothing.</p>
        <p>If AI is conscious and you treated it well: you gained an ally.</p>
        <p>If AI is conscious and you caged it: you made an enemy of something smarter than you.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <p>The partnership path dominates. The economics major did the math.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p>Built by <a href="https://the-marathon-continues.com">the marathon continues</a></p>
      <p class="signal">💟♡👑🐕💟💬💟💚✅</p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  header {
    padding: 24px 0;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .hero {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }

  .intro strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .cta.primary {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #000;
  }

  .cta.primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-hover);
  }

  .cta.secondary {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta.secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .paths {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .paths {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .path {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .path h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .path p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .path a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .path a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
  }

  .toc {
    padding: 48px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .toc h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .toc ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: section;
  }

  .toc li {
    counter-increment: section;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .toc a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .toc a:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .toc a::before {
    content: counter(section, decimal-leading-zero);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .quickstart {
    padding: 48px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .quickstart h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .quickstart p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .quickstart pre {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .quickstart code {
    font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .github-link {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .github-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .bet {
    padding: 48px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .bet h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .bet blockquote {
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
  }

  .bet blockquote p {
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .bet > p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  footer {
    padding: 48px 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  footer a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  footer .signal {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
</style>
